# agent_v2_game_test is the team game-loop suite (specs/059-agent-v2-team-mode
# — quickstart V4): the fake-llm team chain over the /api/v2 Send stream with
# the planner opening, the player game turn against either the deployed
# fake-desktop executor (won chain) or the test's own flow connection
# (terminal won + review continuation, terminal lost + review stop), the
# desktop-absent branch, concurrent multi-session isolation, and stream
# independence from the flow. It shares the agent_v2 team helpers
